---
import Publication from '../layouts/Publication.astro';
import Bookshelf from '../components/Bookshelf.astro';
---
<Publication title="书架">
  <section class="books-intro"><p class="eyebrow">薄肌最终指南 / 书架</p><h1>慢慢读，<br />一步一步练。</h1><p>四册书，32 章规划。从你现在的能力开始。<br />当前已发布 5 章，其余章节计划中。</p><a data-continue class="continue-link" hidden>继续阅读</a></section>
  <Bookshelf />
  <p class="books-footnote">选择一本书查看完整目录。标注“计划中”的章节尚未发布。</p>
</Publication>
